WEBVTT

00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:55.873
After Shu and his friends infiltrated
the Grankingdom border,

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:59.200
they found themselves locked in a battle
against General Logi and his men.

00:02:00.866 --> 00:02:08.096
In the course of the fierce battle,
Shu's team was split apart.

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:11.903
In an overwhelming situation,

00:02:11.933 --> 00:02:17.533
Shu activated a new power
within Blue Dragon,

00:02:17.566 --> 00:02:21.626
and forced Logi to withdraw his unit.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.130
But Shu and the others were left
deep within enemy territory,

00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:27.296
separated,
and on their own.

00:02:27.366 --> 00:02:28.566
Did we do it?

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:30.573
No, no yet.

00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:38.766
This isn't over yet, boy!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.070
Shu!

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.773
Hornet Assassin!

00:02:50.633 --> 00:02:51.303
We're clearing out!

00:02:51.933 --> 00:02:52.603
What?

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:53.700
Just move!

00:03:03.733 --> 00:03:05.233
See you later, boy.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.530
Hold it!

00:03:08.266 --> 00:03:13.326
We'll probably see each other again.
Look forward to it.

00:03:14.533 --> 00:03:15.533
Their presence...

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:16.930
They vanished, maro.

00:03:19.066 --> 00:03:23.966
DRAGNOV'S LAST STAND

00:03:35.266 --> 00:03:37.426
I wonder why the enemy ran away.

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:38.503
Don't know.

00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:44.666
Let's meet up with the others quickly.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.270
I wonder if everyone's okay.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.900
Where is everyone?!

00:04:11.233 --> 00:04:11.903
Oh!

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:20.833
Hey...

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.300
Umm...

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.700
Anybody...

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:26.630
Oh!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.030
Bro! Hurry up!

00:05:06.066 --> 00:05:08.296
Hey wait, you guys.

00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:47.726
This well's dry too, huh?

00:05:58.833 --> 00:05:59.833
You want some?

00:06:07.566 --> 00:06:08.566
There's not enough.

00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:09.473
Yeah.

00:06:10.033 --> 00:06:11.133
Shall we go look for some?

00:06:11.466 --> 00:06:12.126
Huh?

00:06:16.166 --> 00:06:17.166
I'm stepping on it!

00:06:17.533 --> 00:06:18.203
Okay!

00:06:35.366 --> 00:06:39.326
A long time ago, all the land around here
used to be pretty fertile.

00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:47.273
Let's catch it.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:48.900
That pig?

00:06:50.733 --> 00:06:51.833
It's our dinner!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.930
The rendezvous point was
the southeast lake, right?

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.500
Marumaro?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.500
Marumaro! What's the matter?
Did you get hurt in the battle?

00:07:18.266 --> 00:07:18.926
Huh?

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.200
I'm hungry, maro.

00:07:21.433 --> 00:07:23.973
Yeah, but right now there isn't...

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:28.870
Maro.

00:07:32.466 --> 00:07:36.596
Wait, maro!
I won't do anything, maro.

00:07:36.633 --> 00:07:38.103
Hey, Marumaro!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.700
Minotaur!

00:08:00.066 --> 00:08:01.196
What the heck are you?!

00:08:01.233 --> 00:08:02.803
Whoa, hold it!

00:08:05.166 --> 00:08:06.796
Hippopotamus!

00:08:08.366 --> 00:08:09.026
Bouquet?!

00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:11.903
I was scared! So scared!

00:08:11.933 --> 00:08:13.373
But thank goodness!

00:08:13.833 --> 00:08:16.103
I was finally able to see someone!

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:18.800
Okay. Just get away.

00:08:38.733 --> 00:08:39.903
I've been found, huh?

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.000
What were you crying about earlier?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.170
Huh?!

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.170
Did you miss your home
or something?

00:08:55.566 --> 00:08:57.026
I wasn't crying.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.700
It's okay. You're a kid.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.900
So cry when you want to cry.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.070
Huh?

00:09:03.133 --> 00:09:06.173
When you grow up, you won't be
able to cry even when you want to.

00:09:08.933 --> 00:09:10.203
Go on, eat some more.

00:09:11.066 --> 00:09:11.726
Yeah.

00:09:12.933 --> 00:09:14.603
Mister, are you a hunter?

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:16.800
Well, something like that.

00:09:17.166 --> 00:09:18.226
I see.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.130
Lieutenant!
Please respond, Lieutenant!

00:09:22.966 --> 00:09:23.626
Huh?

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.370
What is it?

00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:33.633
The Black Shadow Mobile Troops have
encountered a Shadow Wielder.

00:09:34.166 --> 00:09:36.666
The Shadow has been
identified as Killer Bat.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.670
I see.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.830
Mister, are you
a Grankingdom soldier?

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.230
Don't bother.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.870
I never thought a kid like you
would be a Shadow Wielder.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.530
So what if I'm a kid?!

00:09:52.966 --> 00:09:54.596
I'll help you if you're going home.

00:09:55.233 --> 00:09:57.573
If you go over that way,
you should come out at the border.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.200
I can't go home.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.530
Kids shouldn't be on a battlefield.

00:10:04.866 --> 00:10:06.326
I'm not a kid!

00:10:06.366 --> 00:10:07.366
You are a kid!

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:08.070
Nene is...

00:10:08.766 --> 00:10:09.426
Huh?

00:10:09.633 --> 00:10:12.603
Nene is attacking villages
and kidnapping kids.

00:10:13.066 --> 00:10:15.126
We came to stop him.

00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:18.903
I see. So you're prepared.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:29.100
I'm the commander of the Grankingdom
Black Shadow Mobile Troops.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.770
I'm Lieutenant Dragnov.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.470
I'll crush you without mercy
if I see you on the battlefield.

00:10:36.333 --> 00:10:38.333
I'm Shu, a Shadow Wielder.

00:10:39.233 --> 00:10:39.903
I see.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:03.800
A new model!

00:11:03.933 --> 00:11:05.403
Damn, Grankingdom!

00:11:12.766 --> 00:11:13.996
You little!

00:11:15.533 --> 00:11:17.433
Ray Stinger!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.470
The Shadows have been
upgraded as well?!

00:11:53.866 --> 00:11:55.696
Marumaro is here, maro!

00:12:02.766 --> 00:12:03.426
Report.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:06.300
The enemy units are caught
in the Type One patrol line.

00:12:07.166 --> 00:12:09.626
The Type Two units are
currently engaged in battle.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.530
There are a total of six Shadow Wielders
who infiltrated our territory.

00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:14.426
Who're you?

00:12:17.266 --> 00:12:20.026
Sergeant-Major Schneider,
Independent Flying Squadron.

00:12:20.466 --> 00:12:22.526
I was dispatched here
by General Logi.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:23.970
What's this?

00:12:24.433 --> 00:12:26.773
It's an analysis report on
the Shadow Wielders and their Shadows.

00:12:30.033 --> 00:12:31.203
I don't like this.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:32.170
Huh?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.100
This matter is supposed to
have been left to my unit.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:39.870
It's my mission to report the results
of any battles you have with them.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.000
Do as you like.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.030
What's the status of
the Type Two units?

00:12:43.466 --> 00:12:45.066
Numbers Two through Five
have arrived.

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:48.170
Numbers Six and Seven
have not arrived yet.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.730
We have received word
that number Eight

00:12:50.766 --> 00:12:52.296
will not be able to get there
due to supply issues.

00:12:53.166 --> 00:12:57.396
Hold them up with the first Type Two unit,
along with the remaining Type Ones.

00:12:58.066 --> 00:12:59.726
Avoid close combat
as much as possible.

00:13:00.133 --> 00:13:00.803
Lieutenant!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.800
Shouldn't we wait for additional units?!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.930
I'll be taking command of the front line!

00:13:05.833 --> 00:13:09.173
The front line suits
lucky Dragnov the best.

00:13:09.566 --> 00:13:10.766
Type Twos, move out!

00:13:29.866 --> 00:13:30.866
Where are Jiro and the others?

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.770
They weren't at the meeting point.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:35.170
We heard noises and came here.

00:13:35.466 --> 00:13:37.266
Let's hope every body else
heard it as well.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.770
Ray Stinger!

00:13:47.166 --> 00:13:47.826
Let's go!

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.670
Maro!

00:14:02.666 --> 00:14:04.196
You jerk!

00:14:12.966 --> 00:14:13.626
Jiro.

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.100
Yoo-hoo!

00:14:24.166 --> 00:14:25.466
Did we make it out of the canyon?

00:14:25.866 --> 00:14:26.526
Alright.

00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:27.703
Now...

00:14:36.333 --> 00:14:38.303
What? An ambush?!

00:14:40.433 --> 00:14:43.733
Shadow Wielders really are kids.

00:14:43.933 --> 00:14:46.473
They may be kids,
but the Shadows are the real thing.

00:14:47.466 --> 00:14:52.926
Focus the Type Two units' attack on
the Shadows instead of the users.

00:14:53.466 --> 00:14:56.126
You're not going to attack the users?

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:59.670
It'll be a head-on battle.
Shadow against Shadow.

00:15:00.366 --> 00:15:01.026
Go!

00:15:10.866 --> 00:15:11.866
What's with you?!

00:15:11.966 --> 00:15:14.696
You're a Shadow Wielder,
so fight with everyone!

00:15:14.733 --> 00:15:17.833
I told you! The only power
my Hippo has is transformation!

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.230
Ow!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.600
Hang in there, guys!

00:15:42.933 --> 00:15:44.503
There's too many of them.

00:15:48.433 --> 00:15:49.433
Shu!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.870
Go!

00:15:55.833 --> 00:15:57.003
Blue Dragon.

00:15:57.566 --> 00:15:58.566
So he came, huh?

00:15:59.666 --> 00:16:00.726
Is everyone safe?!

00:16:00.766 --> 00:16:01.766
You're late!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.500
Mister.

00:16:05.733 --> 00:16:07.833
Stay alert. They're coming!

00:16:21.933 --> 00:16:24.533
Blue Dragon, huh?
So rough.

00:16:24.566 --> 00:16:27.066
Definitely not graceful.
But not bad.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.470
Maybe it's too much for
Black Shadow Type Twos, don't you think?

00:16:31.266 --> 00:16:32.466
So it seems.

00:16:32.866 --> 00:16:34.296
Shall I take part?

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.370
I don't need you.

00:16:55.733 --> 00:16:58.073
He's the lucky Dragnov!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.070
Type Twos.
Suspend all attacks on Blue Dragon.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.070
Back off.

00:17:06.566 --> 00:17:07.226
Huh?

00:17:09.533 --> 00:17:11.933
So, Shu.
Why don't we battle it out?

00:17:11.966 --> 00:17:13.296
Just the two of us?

00:17:13.966 --> 00:17:18.766
Fool. You think a simple human
can defeat me?

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:31.870
A Shadow Wielder...

00:17:32.633 --> 00:17:33.773
Okay, bring it!

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.400
I don't want to fight you.

00:17:37.766 --> 00:17:39.696
This is a battlefield!

00:17:42.433 --> 00:17:45.903
You came here prepared, right?!
You'll die if you're not committed!

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:52.200
Go home if you don't want to fight!

00:17:54.533 --> 00:17:55.203
No.

00:17:56.133 --> 00:17:57.673
Yeah! That's the right attitude!

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:01.100
Don't cry, even if you are a kid.
This is a battlefield.

00:18:03.966 --> 00:18:05.496
Alright, let's go!

00:18:05.533 --> 00:18:06.203
Bring it!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.000
I see...

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.870
Go, Berserker!

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:28.730
Don't lose to a phony Shadow like this,
Blue Dragon!

00:18:31.566 --> 00:18:34.366
I'm not like natural Shadow Wielders!

00:18:37.466 --> 00:18:39.996
This is a Shadow I obtained by
putting my life on the line!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:11.470
Shu!

00:19:11.866 --> 00:19:12.866
You little!

00:19:15.633 --> 00:19:17.303
Stop, Marumaro!

00:19:17.466 --> 00:19:18.796
Why, maro?

00:19:18.933 --> 00:19:21.003
I accepted his challenge!

00:19:21.133 --> 00:19:23.473
I don't need any backup!

00:19:28.233 --> 00:19:29.233
Nice!

00:19:29.266 --> 00:19:31.326
This is how battle should be!

00:19:36.866 --> 00:19:38.066
Stop, Schneider!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.200
We're in the middle of
a face-to-face battle!

00:19:52.233 --> 00:19:55.903
Schneider!
This doesn't concern you!

00:19:58.766 --> 00:20:02.996
Is that your knockout technique?!
Then I'll go with one, too!

00:20:07.766 --> 00:20:11.726
Knockout technique!
Fire Crisis!

00:20:12.333 --> 00:20:14.303
Burst Blaze!

00:20:29.166 --> 00:20:30.396
Not bad, Shu!

00:20:37.233 --> 00:20:40.333
The age of chivalry ended long ago.

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.300
Mister?

00:20:59.066 --> 00:21:00.396
Mister!

00:21:00.766 --> 00:21:03.326
Mister! Hang in there, Mister!

00:21:04.666 --> 00:21:08.426
Don't cry...on the battlefield.

00:21:08.966 --> 00:21:12.166
Don't cry, Shu.

00:21:14.033 --> 00:21:16.373
I'm not crying!

00:21:23.566 --> 00:21:26.626
Stay alert!
We're still in the middle of battle!

00:21:27.166 --> 00:21:29.026
We'll fight and bust through!

00:21:30.766 --> 00:21:32.526
Lieutenant Dragnov!
Lieutenant!

00:21:32.866 --> 00:21:34.896
Lieutenant Dragnov!
Please respond!

00:21:35.566 --> 00:21:38.396
Lieutenant Dragnov's been
taken out by Blue Dragon.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.070
I advise a withdrawal.

00:21:43.466 --> 00:21:44.466
No way.

00:21:47.066 --> 00:21:49.696
How much longer until we get to
the capital where Nene is?

00:21:50.033 --> 00:21:51.373
It depends on them.

00:21:53.366 --> 00:21:54.896
Is something the matter, Shu?

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:57.470
Nothing.

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:03.100
It's nothing.

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:06.100
Let's hurry.

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:20.300
Beaten in hand-to-hand combat
by Blue Dragon, eh?

00:22:21.266 --> 00:22:24.566
Seems like a fitting end for
a soldier like Dragnov.

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:30.000
But the Shadow Wielders have
infiltrated the kingdom.

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:32.730
It's easier to handle them
compared to people like Dragnov

00:22:32.766 --> 00:22:34.126
who has the power of the Shadow

00:22:34.166 --> 00:22:36.066
but cannot be incorporated
under my command.

00:22:36.466 --> 00:22:39.696
Those could be more
troublesome than them.

00:24:22.300 --> 00:24:26.370
Unable to pay the admissions fee
to enter the Grankingdom Capital,

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:28.130
Shu and friends take their last resort.

00:24:28.700 --> 00:24:31.830
6000 gold for a full day pass
is way too expensive!

00:24:31.866 --> 00:24:33.766
My monthly allowance
isn't enough to cover for that.

00:24:33.866 --> 00:24:36.126
In that case,
we'll get in for free, maro!

00:24:36.633 --> 00:24:39.003
Next time on Blue Dragon:
"Infiltrate!"
